{"start":"t:body","attrs":{}}
{"text":"\n      "}
{"start":"t:div","attrs":{"facs":"https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-rishon-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-one-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n70.jpg"}}
{"text":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter","n":"135","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/135"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/135/1","n":"1"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Halleluyah: Praise the Name of the Lord, give praise, servants of the Lord "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/135/2","n":"2"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"who stand in the House of the Lord, in the courtyards of the House of God. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/135/3","n":"3"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Halleluyah for the Lord is good, sing to His Name for it is delightful. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/135/4","n":"4"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"For the Lord chose Jacob for Himself, Israel as His own possession. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/135/5","n":"5"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"For I know that the Lord is great, and that our Master is greater than all the deities. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/135/6","n":"6"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"All that the Lord wills He does in heaven and on earth, in the seas and all the depths. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/135/7","n":"7"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"He brings clouds up from the end of the earth, makes lightning with the rain, brings the wind forth from His treasuries. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/135/8","n":"8"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"He slew the firstborn of Egypt from man to beast. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/135/9","n":"9"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"He sent signs and wonders in your midst, O Egypt, against Pharaoh and all his servants. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/135/10","n":"10"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"He smote numerous peoples and slew mighty kings, "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/135/11","n":"11"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Sihon, King of the Amorites, and Og, king of Bashan, and all the realms of Canaan, "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/135/12","n":"12"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"and gave their land as an "}
{"start":"t:pb","attrs":{"ed":"1965","facs":"https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-rishon-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-one-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n72.jpg","n":"21"}}
{"end":"t:pb"}
{"tail":"inheritance, an inheritance to His people Israel. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/135/13","n":"13"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"O Lord, Thy Name endures for ever, O Lord, Thy memory from generation to generation. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/135/14","n":"14"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"For the Lord judges His people and has pity on His servants. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/135/15","n":"15"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"The idols of the nations are of silver and gold, the work of human hands. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/135/16","n":"16"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"They have a mouth and do not speak, they have eyes and do not see. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/135/17","n":"17"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"They have ears and do not hear, nor is there any breath in their mouth. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/135/18","n":"18"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Like them will be those who made them, everyone who trusts in them. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/135/19","n":"19"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"O House of Israel, bless the Lord, O House of Aaron, bless the Lord, "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/135/20","n":"20"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"O House of Levi, praise the Lord, O those that fear the Lord, bless the Lord. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/135/21","n":"21"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Blessed be the Lord from Zion, He Who dwells in Jerusalem. Halleluyah. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n      "}
{"end":"t:div"}
{"tail":"\n    "}
{"end":"t:body"}
